:: Kylar Abduction Free Rescue Defend
<<effects>>
<<npc Bailey 2>>

<<person2>>
<<if ($speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude is "shy")>>
	"B-Bailey is a wonderful guardian..." you say to Jordan, avoiding Bailey's gaze. "I-I'm sorry for causing trouble."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Bailey looks after me," you say to Jordan, tilting your chin up. "Better than most would. We're fine."
<<else>>
	"There's nothing to be concerned about," you say to Jordan. "Bailey takes good care of me."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey's eyes widen slightly before <<his>> expression softens.<<npcincr Bailey dom 3>><<set $bailey_dom += 3>><<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<set $bailey_love += 3>><<set $stockholm_bailey to ($stockholm_bailey || 0) + 1>><<set $stockholm_points to ($stockholm_points || {})>><<set $stockholm_points.kylar to true>><<gggdom "Bailey">><<ggglove "Bailey">><<gbaileystock>>
<br><br>

<<person3>>Jordan smiles at Bailey. "How reassuring. You're very lucky to have such a devoted ward."
<br><br>

<<person2>>Bailey's jaw shifts. <<His>> grip on your shoulder tightens slightly.
<br><br>

"We're done here," <<he>> says to Jordan, not quite looking at either of you. "Thank you for your service."
<br><br>

<<person3>>Jordan nods. "Please be safe." <<He>> makes eye contact with you one last time before disappearing around a corner.
<br><br>

<<person2>>Bailey looks over you.
<br><br>

<<if $bailey_dom lte 30>>
	A muscle in <<his>> neck tenses. "You're smarter than you look. Good," <<he>> says. "Those god-botherers aren't people I want to be in debt to. There's always a price."
<<elseif $bailey_dom gte 70>>
	"Good <<girl>>." Bailey thumbs your shoulder. "Those god-botherers aren't people I want to be in debt to. There's always a price."
<<else>>
	<<He>> exhales once through <<his>> nose. "Good," <<he>> says. "Those god-botherers aren't people I want to be in debt to. There's always a price."
<</if>>
